sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as /api/v1/executions
    participant C as Celery
    participant W as Worker
    participant D as Dispatcher
    participant LP as LeftPupil/APIExecutor
    participant TP as Target API
    participant A as AssertionEngine
    participant EX as ExecutionService
    participant DB as DB

    U->>FE: Run regression
    FE->>API: POST /executions
    API->>C: enqueue task
    C-->>W: deliver task
    W->>D: execute(tc_ir)
    D->>LP: execute(api_ir with assertions)
    LP->>TP: HTTP request
    TP-->>LP: 200 response body
    LP->>A: assert_all(response, rules)
    A-->>LP: passed=false, failed_assertions=[...]
    LP-->>D: result(success=false, assertions_failed)

    D-->>W: StepResult failed
    W->>EX: create_step_result(status=FAILED, details.assertions_failed)
    EX->>DB: insert ExecutionStep
    W->>EX: update_execution_status(FAILED)
    EX->>DB: update Execution

    FE->>API: GET /executions/{id}/result
    API-->>FE: summary.failed + assertions_failed detail
